DLW-SPUN · the full weave of The Ringworld

who   : The Ringworld — The Ringworld (the artifact · the real protagonist).
what  : The artifact, and the real protagonist: a ribbon of scrith a million miles wide and six hundred million long, spun around a star for gravity, with shadow squares for night and rim walls a thousand miles high. Three million times the surface of the Earth, built by Pak Protectors, failing slowly — and worth an entire genre of wonder. The idea is the hero.
where : The Ringworld · the artifact · the real protagonist, within Ringworld.
why   : to hold the office this roll assigns: the artifact · the real protagonist.
